DECISIONS 263, 150, 244, EVALUATION.md §12.2: the budget runs out in a's own evaluation, after phase 2's folds
all passed; stage E's folds (the translated literals, the field default) then fail on the spent counter and
report nothing: E4401 alone, no E3015 budget, since only phase 2's folds report it.
